### 1. Register (tạo user test)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 1. Register (tạo user test)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test1@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. Login lại để lấy token mới (có role ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. Login lại để lấy token mới (có role ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test1@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. Tạo book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/catalog/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "genre": "Fiction",
  "language": "vi",
  "description": "Sach test"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("bookId", response.body.id);
%}

### 4. Tạo product variant (digital)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/catalog/books/{{bookId}}/variants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productType": "DIGITAL",
  "variantFormat": "EBOOK",
  "sku": "TEST-EBOOK-001",
  "price": 50000,
  "currency": "VND"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("variantId", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. Thêm vào giỏ hàng
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productVariantId": "{{variantId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 6. Xem giỏ hàng
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Checkout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Test IPN (giả lập VNPay gọi về)
